<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian-linked drones have struck homes and a United Nations building in Khartoum, killing four, while Sudanese forces intercepted additional drones aimed at the capital. Clashes on Ethiopia's southern border with Kenya at Moyale have disrupted livelihoods and displaced people, prompting travel warnings and calls for refugee support. In the Amhara region, the Fano insurgency continues to threaten water security in the Nile Basin. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPeUhJdlpRZG5aSUZHX3V2YWJqUXBNSFdpZXdtamZnaXdtcDB1SjdtQzlIVzNsOUxtWmdYOTh2S0lWSU16anZhSnhvcmdZSzJwSTM5b1lMSWJneng1dlVPNVRuLUliTWN5QVYxdXpuT0xUM1p1TGZUU3VKdzJybzRGbzdfbWhkWnFHZUpyOWlBd1R6ZE5WMFlIZUdZSlpWd3lXaW9IWEllUkdCZlh2YVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQSV9FZG5DNHVMb2VPcUNIVFBWRzdtY2Zaa0N3THFKTEJ3NnU5aVdHbHJ3WjRmSlFBdXBVZXFodkViSW1sVVM5d0FyLWFKZFFhODBESm5HUEFOUDUzTFUwU3RHcFZFYnl2Zm90RzV5dmpPQjlwSGNHVmJ3bjJwSTdWMDBKemFrU0FMZTdFaGN3aHFzNlNqU0t4NUhpRFVzSEZpWVR6TWxR?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;Amnesty International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWS1JNEdWLXd3U2JuUExha1U0bGJXRDVnWmcxeFFnQTBBSDdDUExoSS1CbVdqZXA2bDBaNkViNURsTHEyWTVETkVOV1VBakpYNGoyeVVKdE1lU3JQQzRrUG5sc3BMelh2REpoUXNEeTNLbW9UVkNEeURsendpN3p4ZWg1ZVk2UUNlSVFIN0ZpR2VpNTdVWnR2SFN0eHFxZXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bombo Radyo Vigan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQdmNRckhiaVVVdDFoeURHR24yM2s0bS1sNXFHVEQ3VXdpMXZ2cGM0Q1dHWkgyZWtJcG14WVI2TnVaUlFOZEZlRHlZTlVucU5ucnFHREFHdU5DeFRrSlBBOTNyUWRTSVplLXdQbE1SdFJjamJWaFh0TnlqZWFqdzdsUmttQUxzLXRCcEN6THJ4RnNQ